This product is a client for Paseo (https://paseo.sh) and talks to it through the
@getpaseo/client SDK.

Parts of the code follow the structure and behavior of the Paseo app
(https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo), Apache License 2.0, Copyright Mohamed Boudra:
  - the timeline reducer (src/paseo/timeline.ts)
  - the agent question form logic (src/ui/modals/question-model.ts)
  - the sidebar and workspace tab models (src/ui/sidebar/model.ts, src/ui/workspace/tabs-model.ts)

Third-party runtime dependencies keep their own licenses: OpenTUI (MIT), React (MIT),
zustand (MIT), beautiful-mermaid (MIT).
